input.prompt:
Implement logo integration for tyler.ag:
1. Update public/index.html: Replace favicon links (lines ~5-8) with:
   &lt;link rel=&quot;icon&quot; type=&quot;image/png&quot; href=&quot;/icon2.png&quot; /&gt;
   &lt;link rel=&quot;apple-touch-icon&quot; href=&quot;/icon2.png&quot; /&gt;
   Keep other head.
2. Update src/App.css: Update .nav-logo rule to:
   .nav-logo {
     font-size: 1.1rem;
     display: flex;
     align-items: center;
     text-decoration: none;
   }
   Add after:
   .nav-logo img {
     height: 2.25rem;
     width: auto;
     transition: transform 0.2s ease, opacity 0.2s ease;
   }
   .nav-logo:hover img {
     transform: scale(1.05);
   }
   .footer .nav-logo img {
     height: 1.5rem;
   }
   Remove old font-weight, letter-spacing, color from .nav-logo (move color to a if needed).
3. Update src/App.tsx, src/pages/PrivacyPolicy.tsx, src/pages/TermsOfService.tsx:
   - Header nav-logo: replace '&lt;Link to=&quot;/&quot; className=&quot;nav-logo&quot;&gt;tyler.ag&lt;/Link&gt;' with '&lt;Link to=&quot;/&quot; className=&quot;nav-logo&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/icon2.png&quot; alt=&quot;Tyler.ag&quot; /&gt;&lt;/Link&gt;'
   - Footer nav-logo: replace '&lt;span className=&quot;nav-logo&quot;&gt;tyler.ag&lt;/span&gt;' with '&lt;Link to=&quot;/&quot; className=&quot;nav-logo&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/icon2.png&quot; alt=&quot;Tyler.ag&quot; /&gt;&lt;/Link&gt;'
4. To enhance attractiveness: In App.css, add fade-in animation to .hero, .services { animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out; } @keyframes fadeInUp { from {opacity:0; transform:translateY(30px);} to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);} }
   Update hero glow to use --accent.
   Ensure mobile: @media (max-width:768px) .nav-logo img {height:1.75rem;} etc.
5. Update public/site.webmanifest: Change icon srcs to &quot;/icon2.png&quot;, update sizes to &quot;192x192&quot; and &quot;512x512&quot; assuming logo scales.
6. Git add public/icon2.png src/assets/icon2.png
7. Run `npm run build` or `npm run preview` to verify no errors. Use bash.
After changes, confirm with git status and say 'Logo integrated and site enhanced'.

input.content:
&lt;!doctype html&gt;
&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;
  &lt;head&gt;
    &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot; /&gt;
    &lt;link rel=&quot;icon&quot; type=&quot;image/png&quot; href=&quot;/icon2.png&quot; /&gt;
    &lt;link rel=&quot;apple-touch-icon&quot; href=&quot;/icon2.png&quot; /&gt;
    &lt;link rel=&quot;manifest&quot; href=&quot;/site.webmanifest&quot; /&gt;
    &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot; /&gt;
    &lt;title&gt;Tyler — AI Consultant&lt;/title&gt;
  &lt;/head&gt;
  &lt;body&gt;
    &lt;div id=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;script type=&quot;module&quot; src=&quot;/src/main.tsx&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
  &lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;

input.old_string:
.nav-logo {
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  color: var(--text-h);
  text-decoration: none;
  letter-spacing: -0.5px;
}

input.new_string:
.nav-logo {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.nav-logo img {
  height: 2.25rem;
  width: auto;
  transition: transform 0.2s ease;
}

.nav-logo:hover img {
  transform: scale(1.05);
}

.footer .nav-logo img {
  height: 1.5rem;
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .nav nav { display: none; }
  .nav-logo img {
    height: 1.75rem;
  }
  .footer .nav-logo img {
    height: 1.25rem;
  }
}

